---

---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden py-10 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-50/50 to-transparent"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
    <span
      class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
    >
      Papelería Creativa y Personalizada
    </span>
    <h1
      class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-normal text-indigo-950 mt-4 sm:mt-6 leading-tight"
    >
      Imprimimos las ideas que <br /><span
        class="italic font-serif text-indigo-600">orbitan</span
      > en tu cabeza.
    </h1>
    <p
      class="mt-3 sm:mt-6 text-sm sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed"
    >
      Hacemos realidad lo que imaginás. Papelería y detalles impresos para
      marcas, eventos y personas.
    </p>

    <!-- CARROUSEL HORIZONTAL EN MÓVIL / GRID EN TABLET Y DESKTOP -->
    <div
      class="mt-8 sm:mt-14 flex sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto pt-2 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory pb-4 sm:pb-0 -mx-4 px-4 sm:mx-auto no-scrollbar"
    >
      <!-- TARJETA 1 -->
      <a
        href="#marcas"
        class="snap-center shrink-0 w-[80vw] max-w-[260px] sm:w-auto paper-card-wrapper paper-rotate-left block group"
      >
        <div
          class="paper-card p-5 sm:p-6 bg-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl block mb-2 sm:mb-3">🚀</span>
          <h4
            class="font-serif font-medium text-indigo-950 text-base sm:text-lg group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors leading-snug"
            style="font-family: 'Moon Time', cursive;"
          >
            Quiero potenciar mi marca
          </h4>
          <p
            class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 font-light leading-relaxed"
          >
            Packaging, stickers y tarjetas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- TARJETA 2 -->
      <a
        href="#eventos"
        class="snap-center shrink-0 w-[80vw] max-w-[260px] sm:w-auto paper-card-wrapper paper-rotate-right block group"
      >
        <div
          class="paper-card p-5 sm:p-6 bg-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl block mb-2 sm:mb-3">✨</span>
          <h3
            class="font-serif font-medium text-indigo-950 text-base sm:text-lg group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors leading-snug"
            style="font-family: 'Moon Time', cursive;"
          >
            Tengo un evento especial
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 font-light leading-relaxed"
          >
            Invitaciones, tags y cartelería.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- TARJETA 3 -->
      <a
        href="#tienda"
        class="snap-center shrink-0 w-[80vw] max-w-[260px] sm:w-auto paper-card-wrapper paper-rotate-center block group"
      >
        <div
          class="paper-card p-5 sm:p-6 bg-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full"
        >
          <span
            class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl block mb-2 sm:mb-3 rotate-90 inline-block"
            >🌙</span
          >
          <h3
            class="font-serif font-medium text-indigo-950 text-base sm:text-lg group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors leading-snug"
            style="font-family: 'Moon Time', cursive;"
          >
            Busco papelería para mí
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 font-light leading-relaxed"
          >
            Cuadernos, agendas y láminas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }
  .no-scrollbar {
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .paper-rotate-left {
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
  }
  .paper-rotate-right {
    transform: rotate(1.5deg);
  }
  .paper-rotate-center {
    transform: rotate(-0.5deg);
  }

  .paper-card-wrapper {
    filter: drop-shadow(2px 8px 10px rgba(45, 35, 66, 0.08));
  }
  .paper-card {
    clip-path: polygon(
      0% 4px,
      8% 0px,
      16% 3px,
      24% 1px,
      32% 4px,
      40% 0px,
      48% 3px,
      56% 1px,
      64% 4px,
      72% 0px,
      80% 3px,
      88% 1px,
      96% 3px,
      100% 1px,
      calc(100% - 2px) 15%,
      100% 30%,
      calc(100% - 3px) 45%,
      100% 60%,
      calc(100% - 2px) 75%,
      100% 90%,
      calc(100% - 1px) 100%,
      92% calc(100% - 3px),
      84% 100%,
      76% calc(100% - 2px),
      68% 100%,
      60% calc(100% - 4px),
      52% 100%,
      44% calc(100% - 2px),
      36% 100%,
      28% calc(100% - 3px),
      20% 100%,
      12% calc(100% - 1px),
      4% 100%,
      0% calc(100% - 2px),
      2px 85%,
      0% 70%,
      3px 55%,
      1px 40%,
      3px 25%,
      1px 10%
    );
  }
</style>
